{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 17:00:38.619494", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Overview:\\nThe network is an SDN star topology with one central switch (switch_0) and multiple edge switches (switch_1, switch_2, switch_3, switch_4). Hosts (host_1, host_2, host_3, host_4) are connected to edge switches, and all devices share a single access subnet (10.0.0.0/24). The management/control network (20.0.0.0/24) is used for OpenFlow communication with the SDN controller at 20.0.0.100.\\n\\n#### Findings:\\n1. **Host Reachability:**\\n   - **host_1**:\\n     - Unable to reach **host_2** (10.0.0.2) and **host_3** (10.0.0.3). The status for these connections is marked as \"unknown,\" indicating potential issues with connectivity or configuration.\\n   - **host_2**:\\n     - Successfully communicates with **host_3** (10.0.0.3) with no packet loss and an average RTT of 13.446 ms.\\n   - **host_3**:\\n     - Successfully communicates with **host_2** (10.0.0.2) with no packet loss and an average RTT of 13.003 ms.\\n   - **host_4**:\\n     - Successfully communicates with **host_2** (10.0.0.2) and **host_3** (10.0.0.3) with no packet loss and average RTTs of 13.122 ms and 12.805 ms, respectively.\\n\\n2. **Anomalies Detected:**\\n   - **host_1** appears to be isolated or experiencing issues, as it cannot reach other hosts in the network. This is abnormal behavior and requires further investigation.\\n   - All other hosts (host_2, host_3, host_4) exhibit normal communication with each other, indicating that the issue is localized to host_1 or its associated edge switch (switch_1).\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nTo further diagnose the root cause of the anomaly, the following areas should be investigated:\\n- Network configuration and connectivity of **host_1** and **switch_1**.\\n- OpenFlow communication between **switch_1** and the SDN controller.\\n- Physical or logical issues with the connection between **switch_1** and the central switch (switch_0).\\n\\nThis report highlights the abnormal behavior and provides a clear focus for further troubleshooting efforts., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='e65d7ac5-5788-4c4d-9f17-b8e72ee10157'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
